<title>USA: EPIX gets $2 mln milestone payment.</title>
<headline>EPIX gets $2 mln milestone payment.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>EPIX Medical Inc said Thursday that it received a $2 million milestone payment from Mallinckrodt Inc, its partner in the development of its lead product candidate, MS-325.</p>
<p>Phase II trials recently began to test the preliminary efficacy of MS-325, an injectable magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) contrast agent, for radiology indications of peripheral vascular disease.</p>
</text>
